000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   S P O H E A D                     PU2-2          *
001200*                                                    *
001300*   THIS SUB PROGRAM MODIFIES PO HEADER INFO.        *
001400*                                                    *
001500******************************************************
001600*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
001700*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
001800*      1. SPOMOD                                     *
001900******************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      *C 04/29/96  CA YODER        REQ #96-023
      *C   ADDED TWO CHECKS AT THE REQUEST OF JIM FISHEL IN UNC TO
      *C   NOT ALLOW AN INVOICELESS PO TO BE CREATED IF THE PO IS
      *C   A MEMO Z-BILL OR A NON-RECEIVABLE PO.
      *C
      *C 05/08/96  CA YODER        REQ #94-005
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO NOT ALLOW THE CURRENCY CODE TO BE CHANGED
      *C   IF ANYTHING HAS ALREADY BEEN RECEIVED FOR THE PO.
      *C
      *C 07/22/96  CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C 10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ALLOW RECEIVING INSTRUCTIONS.  STORE AS 000002 IN
      *C   DPODATAITM.
      *C
      *C 05/15/1997   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CHECK TO NOT ALLOW A PO TO BE MARKED AS INVOICELESS
      *C   IF IT'S A NON-PAYABLE PO.
      *C
      *C 12/03/97  CA YODER
      *C   FOUND THAT SOME POS CONTAIN AN "N" IN THE INVOICELESS
      *C   INDICATOR FIELD INSTEAD OF " " OR "X".  THIS WAS CAUSING
      *C   A PROBLEM WHEN MODIFYING THE HEADER.  ADDED "N" AS A VALID
      *C   VALUE SO THAT MESSAGE 03206 WOULDN'T BE DISPLAYED.
      *C
      *C 02/19/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO VALIDATE VALUE IN INVOICELESS INDICATOR
      *C   FIELD BECAUSE THIS PROGRAM WAS WRITING A "Y" OR "N" INSTEAD
      *C   OF "X" OR " " IN SOME CASES.
      *C
      *C 05/04/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CHANGE OF PO-FOLLOWUP-DATE AS A CONDITION FOR A
      *C   CALL TO "SEDIPOLG."  WITH THE NEW SUB-TRANSACTIONS IN
      *C   "TEDIABST," FOLLOW-UPS CAN NOW BE SENT THROUGH EDI.
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 09/09/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   MOVE ITM-ZBILL-VALUE TO SPOMSTRM PARAMETERS SO THAT THE
      *C   VALUE CAN BE CONVERTED WHEN THE CURRENCY CODE IS CHANGED.
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 03/01/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST    (D. STUBBS)
      *C   REMOVED LOGIC TO UPDATE MARKET COST ON REPAIR ORDERS.
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 05/15/03  DCR     DCR01  DAN RAUCH
      *C   ADD LOGIC TO PROMPT(F4) FOR FOB DESCRIPTIONS
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 08/12/03  DCR     DCR02  DAN RAUCH
      *C   ADD LOGIC TO PROMPT(F4) FOR VIA DESCRIPTIONS
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 07/20/04  CAY     CAY01  CA YODER      NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   COMMENTED OUT EDIT CHECK FOR CHANGING THE INVOICELESS
      *C   FLAG ON REQUIREMENT ORDERS.
      *C -------------------------------------------------------------
002000
010000
010100
