               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
                                      DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-E
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(52) IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2.

