DCR01      IF DE2-FOB = PO-FOB
DCR01          NEXT SENTENCE
DCR01      ELSE
DCR01          MOVE "Y"         TO  CHG-TERMS-OR-FOB-SW
DCR01      END-IF.
DCR01
DCR01 *==  SEND THE ENTIRE FIELD TO BE VALIDATED AS FOB DESCRIPTION
DCR01      IF  DE2-FOB-4-20 NOT = SPACES
DCR01          MOVE DE2-FOB       TO WS-ZFOB-FOB-DESC
DCR01      END-IF.
DCR01
DCR01 *==  SEND THE 1ST THREE CHARACTERS TO BE VALIDATED AS FOB CODE
DCR01      IF  DE2-FOB-CD13 NOT = SPACES
DCR01          IF  DE2-FOB-4-20 = SPACES
DCR01              MOVE DE2-FOB-CD13  TO WS-ZFOB-FOB-CODE
DCR01          END-IF
DCR01      END-IF.

DCR01      PERFORM ZFOB-READK-FOBDSC     THRU ZFOB-READK-EXIT.
DCR01      IF  WS-ZFOB-FOB-ERR  = "E"
DCR01 ***  "FOB CODE IS INVALID"
DCR01          MOVE WS-ZFOB-SAVE-FOB  TO DE2-FOB
DCR01          MOVE   6 TO LANG-SETNUM
DCR01          MOVE 052 TO LANG-MSGNUM
DCR01          PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
DCR01          MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE2-MESSAGE-LINE
DCR01                                 DE2-MESSAGE-LINE-E
DCR01          MOVE 20      TO  FIELD-NUMBER
DCR01          PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
DCR01          GO TO 61-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2
DCR01      END-IF.

DCR01      MOVE WS-ZFOB-FOB-DESC  TO DE2-FOB.
DCR01
DCR01      GO TO 61-EDIT-PAYMENT-TERMS.
