140200**   THIS ROUTINE IS EXECUTED IF VENDOR CODE IS    **
140300**   CHANGED AND THIS IS A CODED P.O.              **
140400**    IT UPDATES TWO DATA SETS:                    **
140500**     A. WHILE DOING A SERIAL READ OF DPOITEM     **
140600**        IT FINDS THE CODE AND UPDATES THE FIELD  **
140700**        LAST VENDOR OF MSTORERM IF THE LAST PO   **
140800**        IS A MATCH WITH THE P.O. BEING MODIFIED  **
140900**     B. WHILE DOING THE SERIAL READ OF DPOITEM   **
141000**        ANY DVENDITM SEG. WITH THE OLD VENDOR    **
141100**        CODE IS DELETED IF THERE ARE NO LEAD     **
141200**        TIMES AND IT IS NOT A QUOTE 'Q'. THEN    **
141300**        A DVENDITM SEG. IS EITHER UPDATED OR     **
141400**        ADDED TO CONTAIN THE NEW VENDOR CODE AND **
141500**        AND CORP CODE. PRICE, UM, FOB, AND TERMS **
141600**        ARE UPDATED OR PUT INTO DVENDITM AT      **
141700**        THIS TIME.                               **
