151300         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
151400
151500 611-DVENDITM-CHECK.
151600     IF VENDITM-EXISTS-FLAG = "Y"
151700         GO TO 611-GET-DPOITEMS.
151800
151900 611-CONT-DVENDITM-CHECK.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
